{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1497098-trinity-continuum-sara-kaur-theory","id":1497098,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Sara Kaur Theory","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-11-14T09:55:47-08:00","id":1497098,"title":"[Trinity Continuum] Sara Kaur Theory","content":"<b>Trinity Continuum</b> cause we talk about Sara Kaur in all her interations in... well, Continuum. \ud83d\ude0e<br /> <br /> So <b>Sara</b> was Indian scientist that helped in Hammersmith Incident - and later removed herself slowly from formed Aeon Society. What is her later fate?<br /> <br /> What were general study fields of Sara Kaur about Inspired and Energies? Especially around War War 2?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T14:59:59-08:00","id":1497125,"title":"","content":"Back during the Hammersmith event, she was Sir Calvin's personal secretary/assistant, and received much of her advanced education reading the books from his library. After returning to India she earned a bunch of doctorates under a variety of names. She studied theoretical physics and several other hard sciences as well as philosophy and (I think) theology. I believe she studied biophysics during the Nova Age and was poking around the city of Cascade with a team of psiads looking for alien technology during the 2080s.<br /> <br /> No idea what she was specifically studying during WWII, but it was presumably more science of some sort, and given the march of progress, she may have gotten multiple degrees in the same fields over the decades to keep up with the newest research.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25506,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","user":"Shepherdboi","date":". 11-14-2022, 11:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T17:05:12-08:00","id":1497132,"title":"","content":"SPOILERS<br /> ...<br /> ....<br /> ...<br /> ....<br /> ....<br /> .....<br /> ,,,<br /> ....<br /> <br /> <br /> .........<br /> ....<br /> .<br /> ,<br /> ....<br /> <br /> She\u2019s the quantikinesis proxy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T18:04:13-08:00","id":1497143,"title":"","content":"Quantikinesis is 'meta magic' of Aeon Psions? And with Psi working from users mind - she would need to dwell hard on human mind activities, to understand it in first place? \ud83e\udd14","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T19:46:56-08:00","id":1497158,"title":"","content":"QK has 3 modes, Energetics that creates/controls/changes energy, Transmutation that creates/controls/changes matter, and Fundamentals that controls Psi and Quantum, not exactly with meta magic style, but making it harder or easier to use powers, transforming powers into psi or quantum, changing psi into quantum and vice versa, among other effects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T18:13:22-08:00","id":1497245,"title":"","content":"Unlike Max Mercer and Divas Mal she kind of didn't get involved in the world altering stuff by choice. She was fine minding her own business basically being an unusually powerful psiad until she was turned into the Quantakinesis Proxy, and it's unclear if any of her actions between then and the destruction of the Chitra Bhanu were actually her own.<br /> <br /> Note that a species aptitude for Quantakinesis is rare in the Trinity Universe, enough that by Aeon humans are the only known species in explored space to have it (and the only one the Doyens have encountered as well). It's technobabble definition is that it primarily messed around with quantum mechanics and IIRC particularly the strong and weak forces, which just so happens to be the same thing Novas apparently manipulate to fire their armpit beams or fly. I suppose Psi gets effected because noetic stuff is supposed to deal with whatever's just below the quantum level. There's probably yet another Aptitude that allows limited messing around with Talent-adjacebt stuff, Chronokinesis or the like, but be thankful that nobody seems to have developed that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}